# International text #i18n

Mixed scripts can be explicit at span level: [testo italiano]{lang="it" dir="ltr"}, [مرحبا بالعالم]{lang="ar" dir="rtl"}, [中文内容]{lang="zh" dir="ltr"}.

::note {type="tip"}
Use document metadata for the default language and direction, then override only the spans or blocks that need it.
::note
